{
    "title": "Mahjong Solitaire - Tile Match",
    "description": "Mahjong Solitaire is a thrilling tile-match game that offers a perfect blend of classic mahjong and relaxing gameplay. Immerse yourself in the serene beauty of this mahjong journey and take a break from your hectic schedule. \r\nHone your strategic skills to match tiles in this timeless mahjong puzzle game. Tackle challenging levels that will leave you feeling refreshed and rejuvenated. Power-ups and obstacles add a new twist to every mahjong level, making the game even more exciting and unpredictable.\r\nAs you progress through the game, don't forget to collect your free mahjong rewards. Mahjong Solitaire is an engaging game that offers a unique blend of strategy and relaxation, making it perfect for players of all skill levels.\r\nThe objective of the game is to match open pairs of identical tiles and remove all tiles to complete the board. With its captivating gameplay, Mahjong Solitaire has captured the hearts of puzzle enthusiasts worldwide. So get ready for a classic mahjong solitaire quest that will keep you coming back for more!\r\n\r\n\r\nHow to play\r\n\r\n- Match the same tiles on the board!\r\n- Tap two of the same tiles to remove them!\r\n- Use a booster when you are having a hard time!\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>Features</b>\r\n\r\n- Easy to learn and quite addictive\r\n- No time limit, so no rush, just relax playing matching tiles\r\n- Beautiful graphics and various layouts\r\n- Hours of gameplay for you to enjoy\r\n- Free to play and no wifi needed\r\n\r\nWith thousands of mahjong puzzles in various layouts and stunning graphics, this game is sure to keep you entertained for hours. If you love playing classic mahjong games, puzzle games, dominoes games, chess games, or other board games, then Mahjong Solitaire is the perfect game for you!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Mahjong Solitaire is a thrilling tile-match game that offers a perfect blend of classic mahjong and relaxing gameplay. Immerse yourself in the serene beauty of this mahjong journey and take a break from your hectic schedule. <br>Hone your strategic skills to match tiles in this timeless mahjong puzzle game. Tackle challenging levels that will leave you feeling refreshed and rejuvenated. Power-ups and obstacles add a new twist to every mahjong level, making the game even more exciting and unpredictable.<br>As you progress through the game, don&#39;t forget to collect your free mahjong rewards. Mahjong Solitaire is an engaging game that offers a unique blend of strategy and relaxation, making it perfect for players of all skill levels.<br>The objective of the game is to match open pairs of identical tiles and remove all tiles to complete the board. With its captivating gameplay, Mahjong Solitaire has captured the hearts of puzzle enthusiasts worldwide. So get ready for a classic mahjong solitaire quest that will keep you coming back for more!<br><br><br>How to play<br><br>- Match the same tiles on the board!<br>- Tap two of the same tiles to remove them!<br>- Use a booster when you are having a hard time!<br><br><br><b>Features</b><br><br>- Easy to learn and quite addictive<br>- No time limit, so no rush, just relax playing matching tiles<br>- Beautiful graphics and various layouts<br>- Hours of gameplay for you to enjoy<br>- Free to play and no wifi needed<br><br>With thousands of mahjong puzzles in various layouts and stunning graphics, this game is sure to keep you entertained for hours. If you love playing classic mahjong games, puzzle games, dominoes games, chess games, or other board games, then Mahjong Solitaire is the perfect game for you!",
    "summary": "Exercise your brain and immerse yourself in the ultimate Mahjong puzzle!",
